<section class="section manual-next">
  <div class="container">
    <h2>Who this manual is for</h2>
    <ul class="prose">
      <li><strong>External researchers and students</strong>: New users of Starrydata2. We recommend reading chapters in order: Account Registration → Search → Download.</li>
      <li><strong>Data curators</strong>: Researchers who want to register data from their own papers or their group's papers. Focus on Chapter 3.</li>
      <li><strong>API / programmatic users</strong>: Researchers who want to handle bulk data for machine learning. Focus on Chapter 4.</li>
    </ul>

